{
  // The skill tree. Every "skillPointEvery" levels give a point (game.json); each rank of a skill costs one.
  // There are far more ranks than points over 99 levels, so every hero ends up different.
  // branch: one of "branches". pos: [column 0..2, row from the top] inside the branch.
  // requires: [skill, rank] that must be learned first. level: hero level needed for the first rank.
  // icon: sprite shown on the node (config/sprites.json). effects: what each rank adds. Stats:
  //   dmg (melee and crossbow damage), hp (half hearts), ward (damage blocked from strong hits),
  //   speed (% movement), crit (% chance of a double hit), leech (% chance to heal half a heart on a kill),
  //   bow (crossbow damage), roll (% shorter dodge cooldown), heal (% more from healing items),
  //   regen (heals half a heart every 10 s out of combat, faster with more ranks), gold (% more gold),
  //   loot (% more gear drops), whirl (unlocks Whirlwind), whirlcd (% shorter Whirlwind cooldown),
  //   whirldmg (% more Whirlwind damage).
  // Active skills (each has its own key, see controls.json): whirl, warcry, leap, stoneskin, volley.
